# Watercolour originals — 100MB+ scans. The web-ready JPEGs live in
# site/public/watercolours/ and are generated from these by
# site/scripts/watercolours.mjs.
#
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. Unanchored, `Watercolours/` matches a
# folder of that name at any depth — and because macOS sets
# core.ignoreCase=true, it also matched site/public/watercolours/ and silently
# excluded 31 of the 43 published images.
/Watercolours/
